# Introduction to EDR

Completed the Introduction to EDR room on TryHackMe.

## Key Topics Covered

* EDR fundamentals
* SOC workflows
* Endpoint telemetry
* Threat detection
* Incident response
* Alert investigation

## What I Learned

This room introduced the core concepts of Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR) and how EDR solutions extend beyond traditional antivirus capabilities.

I explored:

* the basic architecture of EDR platforms
* how endpoint telemetry is collected and analyzed
* detection and response capabilities
* investigation workflows used by SOC analysts

The practical investigation exercises provided hands-on experience analyzing detections in a simulated EDR environment.

## Takeaway

This room helped strengthen my understanding of modern endpoint security monitoring and established a solid foundation for future SOC analyst training.
